## 🔥 What Is This?

AxisGuard X is a lightweight **Endpoint Detection & Response (EDR)** tool I built from scratch.

Most EDRs cost thousands and run in the cloud. Mine runs locally, watches your processes in real-time, and kills threats the second they appear.

## ⚡ Features

- **Real-time Process Monitoring** — Watches every process as it starts
- **Signature Detection** — Flags known malicious tools (Mimikatz, Nmap, etc.)
- **Auto-Kill** — Instantly terminates threats before they can run
- **Live Dashboard** — Beautiful Streamlit dashboard with live alerts
- **JSON Logging** — Every alert + kill is logged to `alerts.json` / `killed.json`
- **100% Offline** — No data leaves your PC

## 📸 Dashboard
![Dashboard](dashboard.png)

Run the dashboard to see live alerts, killed processes, and system status in your browser.

